<title>ISRAEL: U.S. envoy Ross meets Netanyahu on Hebron talks.</title>
<headline>U.S. envoy Ross meets Netanyahu on Hebron talks.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Middle East envoy Dennis Ross met Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu on Saturday in efforts to push forward talks with the PLO on a partial Israeli withdrawal from Hebron, witnesses said.</p>
<p>Ross arrived in Israel late on Saturday and travelled to Jerusalem for the meeting at Netanyahu's home.</p>
<p>He was expected to meet Palestinian President Yasser Arafat later on Saturday.</p>
</text>
